{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/privacy-policy/layout,_N_T_/privacy-policy/page,_N_T_/privacy-policy"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/privacy-policy/__PAGE__","/privacy-policy","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0wa60lc2wlwoc.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/15orcrkp-_9ct.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2ncdmtj91g36a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/166-a3utgd-lq.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-10b5wutro9flo.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script async=\"\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-6710458178434465\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-C9HPD23Y02\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><title>Privacy Policy — Animal Name Generator</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Animal Name Generator Privacy Policy. Covers Google Analytics, cookies, AdSense, GDPR, CCPA, data collection, and how we protect your information.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"animal names, pet name generator, dog names, cat names, male names, female names, cute names\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"p:domain_verify\" content=\"acc18c9aa2855ead49c874b6cac9cb61\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://bestanimalnames.com/privacy-policy/\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Privacy Policy — Animal Name Generator\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Comprehensive privacy policy covering GDPR, CCPA, cookies, Google AdSense, and data protection.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Privacy Policy — Animal Name Generator\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Comprehensive privacy policy covering GDPR, CCPA, cookies, and data protection.\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\",\"description\":\"Free animal name generator with 989+ animals. Browse thousands of name ideas across 9 categories.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animals?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#f8fafc] text-[#1e293b]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/\">🐾 AnimalNameGen</a><div class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Animals</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/japanese-animal-names/\">Guides</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\" aria-label=\"Main content\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/privacy-policy/\"}]}</script><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"text-gray-300\">/</span><span class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium\">Privacy Policy</span></nav><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-indigo-700 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-14 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4\">🔒 Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"text-indigo-100 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto\">Your privacy matters. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information.</p></div></section><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\"><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">Last updated: June 3, 2026</p><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">1. Introduction</h2><p>Animal Name Generator (“we,” “our,” or “us”) is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website. We minimize data collection wherever possible — we do not require user accounts and only collect personal information through our voluntary contact form.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">2. Information We Collect</h2><p><strong>Voluntary:</strong> When you use our contact form, you may provide your name, email, and message — used solely to respond to your inquiry.</p><p class=\"mt-2\"><strong>Automatic:</strong> We collect log data (IP address, browser type, pages visited), device information, and usage data through standard server logs and analytics.</p><p class=\"mt-2\"><strong>We do NOT collect:</strong> Financial information, government IDs, health data, precise geolocation, or data from children under 13.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">3. Google Analytics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics to understand site usage. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect data about your visit — pages viewed, time on site, referring URLs — and transmits this to Google servers in the United States. You can opt out via the <a href=\"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline\">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">4. Cookies</h2><p>We use essential cookies for site functionality, analytics cookies (Google Analytics), and advertising cookies (Google AdSense). For full details, see our <a class=\"text-primary underline\" href=\"/cookie-policy/\">Cookie Policy</a>.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">5. Google AdSense &amp; Advertising</h2><p>We use Google AdSense to display ads. Google uses cookies to serve ads based on your browsing history. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href=\"https://adssettings.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline\">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href=\"https://www.aboutads.info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline\">aboutads.info</a>.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">6. GDPR Compliance (EU/EEA)</h2><p>EU/EEA residents have rights under GDPR: right of access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection, and data portability. Contact us at <strong>support@bestanimalnames.com</strong> to exercise these rights. We respond within 30 days.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">7. CCPA Compliance (California)</h2><p>California residents have rights under CCPA/CPRA: right to know what personal information we collect, right to delete it, and right to opt-out of sale. We do not sell personal information as defined under CCPA. Contact us at <strong>support@bestanimalnames.com</strong> with “CCPA Request” in the subject line.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">8. Data Security &amp; Retention</h2><p>We implement HTTPS encryption and appropriate security measures. Contact form submissions are retained up to 12 months. Analytics data retention follows Google’s policies. No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">9. Contact</h2><p>Questions about this Privacy Policy? Email us at <strong>support@bestanimalnames.com</strong> or use our <a class=\"text-primary underline\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 py-10\" aria-label=\"Site footer\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8\"><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Company</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about/\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/editorial-policy/\">Editorial Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/how-we-create-content/\">How We Create Content</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/faq/\">FAQ</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Legal</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/privacy-policy/\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/terms/\">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/disclaimer/\">Disclaimer</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/cookie-policy/\">Cookie Policy</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Resources</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">All Animals</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/animal/dog/\">Dog Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/animal/cat/\">Cat Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/sitemap.xml\">Sitemap</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Popular Guides</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-dog/\">How to Name Your Dog</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-cat/\">How to Name Your Cat</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/japanese-animal-names/\">Japanese Animal Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/mythological-animal-names/\">Mythological Names</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Latest Blog</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/top-100-dog-names-2024/\">Top 100 Dog Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/unique-cat-names-stand-out/\">Unique Cat Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/mythological-animal-names/\">Mythological Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/norse-viking-animal-names/\">Norse Viking Names</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 pt-6 border-t border-gray-800 text-center text-xs text-gray-500\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Animal Name Generator. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0wa60lc2wlwoc.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[54576,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"GoogleAnalytics\\\"]\\n3:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n10:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"privacy-policy\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"privacy-policy\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",16],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-1\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"child